@startuml
autonumber
actor "Receptionist" as Rec
participant ":System" as System

activate Rec

Rec -> System : asks to schedule a vaccination for an SNS User
activate System

System --> Rec : requests the SNS User Number
deactivate System

Rec -> System : types the SNS User Number
activate System

System --> Rec : shows list of vaccination centers and asks to select one
deactivate System

Rec -> System : selects a vaccination center
activate System

System --> Rec : asks to select the vaccine type (if applicable)
deactivate System

Rec -> System : selects the vaccine type
activate System

System --> Rec : requests the preferred date
deactivate System

Rec -> System : types the date
activate System

System --> Rec : shows available time slots for that date
deactivate System

Rec -> System : selects a time slot
activate System

System --> Rec : shows all data and requests confirmation
deactivate System

Rec -> System : confirms the data
activate System

System --> Rec : informs operation success
deactivate System

deactivate Rec
@enduml